Package: bgns
Title: BGNS: Biweight Graph and Network Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Aditya", family = "Kshirsagar", email = "adityag3vtp@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
 )
Description: Robust biweight midcorrelation (bicor) kernels with NA-aware
    pairwise handling, plus KNN/graph construction and clustering wrappers
    compatible with tgstat graph utilities. The C++ core uses a strict
    pairwise formulation with an optimized BLAS fast path on NA-free data,
    yielding robust, outlier-resistant similarity graphs at scale.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    tgstat,
    Matrix
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
SystemRequirements: C++17, OpenMP (optional)
BugReports: https://github.com/metaddict/bgns/issues
URL: https://github.com/metaddict/bgns
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
LazyLoad: no
ByteCompile: no
